Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:30:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): open a model or project file given on the command
 line

camcraft-ui <file> imports a model (.stl, .obj, .step, .stp, and a
Solidcraft .sc on native builds) through CommandKind::ImportFile, and
opens a .camproj through CommandKind::OpenProjectFile: the commands of
the Model and Project dialogs and of a drop. The file arguments come
from the same walk as the option check, so an option's value is never
read as a file. More than one file, an unknown extension or a path that
is not a file is refused by name on the status line, and the app starts
with an empty project. --help shows the file argument.

Fixes #2462

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
